{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772835754445,"story":{"title":"Drago's Big Day","userPrompt":"A brave little dragon","authorStyleId":"sandra-boynton","readingLevel":"early","illustrationStyleId":"cartoon_comic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Drago was small.\nDrago was green.\nHe had a big wish!\nTo be a king…\nBut first, be kind!\nThat's what they sing.","illustrationPrompt":"Drago, a small, bright green dragon with big, hopeful eyes, stands in a field of yellow flowers. He wears a tiny crown tilted on his head. Sunny day, blue sky. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772835573593,"durationMs":5462,"retries":0,"promptLength":753,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A small emerald green scales with a lighter lime green belly dragon, big-expressive bright yellow eyes with determined, hopeful expression, small, rounded horns, tiny wings that are slightly too small for flying efficiently, a small wisp of smoke that occasionally puffs from his nostrils, a slightly oversized crown, chubby build. Drago standing proudly, looking determined, with a small crown slightly askew on his head. He's surrounded by a whimsical meadow setting with flowers and gentle hills. The text should be visible but not overwhelming. in Whimsical Meadow. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"He saw a sad sheep.\n\"Why do you weep?\"\nDrago asked low.\nSheep said, \"My toy broke!\nMy boat won't float!\"\nPoor Sheep, so slow.","illustrationPrompt":"Drago, looking concerned, kneels next to a fluffy white sheep who is sitting sadly on the grass. A broken toy boat is beside the sheep. Background: green hills. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772835574696,"durationMs":6558,"re